@startuml 03-componentes-backend
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title Components — Flask backend (`code/backend/server.py` & production)

component [Flask App\n(CORS)] as Flask

interface "HTTP / JSON" as HTTP

component [Ingest routes\nPOST /api/ingest] as Ingest
component [Query routes\nGET /api/latest/{id}\nGET /api/history/{id}\nGET /api/stats/{id}] as Query
component [Maintenance\nPOST /api/clear] as Clear
component [Optional legacy UI\nGET / (HTML dashboard)] as LegacyUi
component [Persistence layer\nsqlite3] as Repo
database "SQLite file" as File

HTTP - Flask
Flask -down- Ingest
Flask -down- Query
Flask -down- Clear
Flask -down- LegacyUi
Ingest -down-> Repo : INSERT
Query -down-> Repo : SELECT
Clear -down-> Repo : DELETE / cleanup
LegacyUi ..> Repo : optional\n(separate routes)

Repo -right- File

note right of Ingest
  Supports nested payload
  (sensor + data) and legacy
  flat format.
end note

@enduml
